  "description": "Exhilaration everywhere\nA thrilling 160mm full-carbon eMTB, engineered to be ridden hard, fast and without compromise. Combining proportional geometry with size-specific tuning Karve RSX delivers perfectly balanced handling for every rider. Confidence-inspiring and relentlessly capable, it’s built for those who demand more from every trail. Wherever you point it – steep descents, technical climbs or demanding back-country terrain – it delivers the poise, power and control to hold its line when it matters most. Precise handling, powerful support and an assured, planted feel let you press on, commit fully and carry speed where others hold back. Designed, developed and proven in Britain’s hard country — where riding is never easy – it reflects a simple principle: when conditions are toughest, design has to be right. The result is a bike that’s resilient, adaptable and built to perform, ride after ride.\n\nHighlights\n– 160mm front + 160mm rear of proven Quad-Link 4 suspension, with carefully custom-tuned rear shocks.\n– Uni-directional full carbon fibre frame with geometry adjustment is light and reassuringly strong + factory fitted with RideWrap frame protection.\n– Avinox M2S full-torque (up to 150Nm), full-power (1300W peak) motor with five assistance modes (auto, eco, trail, turbo + boost) + 12A fast charger.\n– SRAM AXS Eagle 1x12 transmission + SRAM Maven Silver four-piston hydraulic brakes.\n– Avinox DPC100 OLED top-tube touchscreen display delivers a wealth of customisable information at your fingertips.\n– 800Wh internal battery so you can ride further.\n– DT Swiss Hybrid H1900 29in trail-smoothing wheels front and rear + MX ready.\n\nIdeal for... Enthusiast riders who want a light, mid-travel full-power enduro-capable eMTB that delivers the very best handling and performance possible for maximum thrills – everywhere.\n\nCharge time (800Wh): 80% in 1hr 45mins approx. from empty, and to 100% in 2hrs 23mins approx. with 12A fast charger.\n\nDiscover Karve >",
